1
00:00:01,007 --> 00:00:03,347
♪

2
00:00:03,347 --> 00:00:04,387
Eugeo: ELDRIE?

3
00:00:04,387 --> 00:00:06,267
I KNOW THAT NAME.

4
00:00:06,267 --> 00:00:08,267
- Kirito: HEY.
- ( Eugeo gasps )

5
00:00:08,267 --> 00:00:11,227
Kirito: GET READY.
I’M GONNA KEEP HIM BUSY.

6
00:00:11,227 --> 00:00:13,017
WHEN I GIVE THE SIGNAL,
YOU’RE UP.

7
00:00:13,017 --> 00:00:13,937
Eugeo: GOT IT.

8
00:00:16,397 --> 00:00:19,487
Eldrie: USING YOUR CHAINS
AS A WEAPON, EH?

9
00:00:19,487 --> 00:00:24,077
THEN I’LL FOREGO MY SWORD
AND USE THIS INSTEAD.

10
00:00:24,077 --> 00:00:28,327
SYSTEM CALL! ENHANCE ARMAMENT!

11
00:00:28,327 --> 00:00:30,077
- ( Eugeo gasps )
- Kirito: DON’T SWEAT IT.

12
00:00:30,077 --> 00:00:32,207
A WHIP CAN ONLY REACH SO FAR.

13
00:00:32,207 --> 00:00:33,667
Eldrie: HAH!

14
00:00:33,667 --> 00:00:35,297
Kirito: WE’RE SAFE HERE.

15
00:00:35,297 --> 00:00:36,507
( gasps )

16
00:00:36,507 --> 00:00:38,007
OH, SHI--

17
00:00:41,587 --> 00:00:43,097
Eldrie: IMPRESSIVE!

18
00:00:43,097 --> 00:00:45,307
MY DIVINE FROSTSCALE WHIP
IS FAST,

19
00:00:45,307 --> 00:00:47,177
BUT IT SEEMS YOU’RE FASTER.

20
00:00:47,177 --> 00:00:48,727
Eugeo: YOU ALL RIGHT?! ( gasps )

21
00:00:48,727 --> 00:00:51,477
HIS WHIP DID THAT?

22
00:00:51,477 --> 00:00:54,687
Kirito: EUGEO, I’LL TRY
TO FIND A WAY TO STOP HIS WHIP.

23
00:00:54,687 --> 00:00:56,397
YOU SNEAK AROUND BACK.

24
00:00:56,397 --> 00:00:57,987
( Eugeo grunts )

25
00:00:57,987 --> 00:01:00,027
Eldrie: IF YOU’VE
FINISHED PLOTTING,

26
00:01:00,027 --> 00:01:01,447
WE SHOULD WRAP THIS UP.

27
00:01:01,447 --> 00:01:05,737
NOW COME AT ME,
AND KEEP ME ENTERTAINED.

28
00:01:05,737 --> 00:01:07,287
♪

29
00:01:07,287 --> 00:01:09,577
♪ SHINY SWORD, MY DIAMOND ♪

30
00:01:09,577 --> 00:01:11,457
( singing in Japanese )

31
00:01:22,587 --> 00:01:23,587
♪ IT’S TIME ♪

32
00:01:23,587 --> 00:01:25,427
( singing in Japanese )

33
00:01:41,697 --> 00:01:43,607
♪

34
00:02:44,197 --> 00:02:45,407
Kirito: SYSTEM CALL!

35
00:02:45,407 --> 00:02:48,787
GENERATE THERMAL ELEMENT!

36
00:02:48,787 --> 00:02:52,047
Eldrie: GENERATE
CRYOGENIC ELEMENT.

37
00:02:54,337 --> 00:02:56,967
Kirito: FORM ELEMENT,
ARROW SHAPE!

38
00:02:56,967 --> 00:03:00,177
Eldrie: FORM ELEMENT,
BIRD SHAPE.

39
00:03:00,177 --> 00:03:02,557
COUNTER THERMAL OBJECT.

40
00:03:04,637 --> 00:03:05,847
Kirito: DISCHARGE!

41
00:03:05,847 --> 00:03:07,557
Eldrie: DISCHARGE.

42
00:03:13,517 --> 00:03:14,317
( Kirito yells )

43
00:03:15,737 --> 00:03:16,937
( Eldrie chuckles )

44
00:03:19,737 --> 00:03:21,317
- ( Kirito gasps )
- ( Eldrie grunts )

45
00:03:22,737 --> 00:03:24,447
( Kirito groans )

46
00:03:24,447 --> 00:03:26,287
( gags )

47
00:03:29,117 --> 00:03:32,337
( Eldrie sighs )
IT SEEMS I OVERESTIMATED YOU.

48
00:03:32,337 --> 00:03:34,797
HOWEVER, I AM MERCIFUL.

49
00:03:34,797 --> 00:03:37,467
YOU’LL BE UNCONSCIOUS
BEFORE YOU KNOW IT.

50
00:03:37,467 --> 00:03:40,257
♪

51
00:03:40,257 --> 00:03:42,137
( Eugeo yells )

52
00:03:44,177 --> 00:03:46,467
( Kirito yells )

53
00:03:49,437 --> 00:03:50,477
MY TURN!

54
00:03:53,817 --> 00:03:56,567
Eldrie: PERHAPS IT
WAS PRESUMPTUOUS OF ME

55
00:03:56,567 --> 00:03:58,487
TO UNDERESTIMATE YOU EARLIER.

56
00:03:58,487 --> 00:04:02,237
IT SEEMS YOU’VE MANAGED
TO DO ME SOME HARM AFTER ALL.

57
00:04:02,237 --> 00:04:04,277
Kirito: YEAH, WELL,
THAT’S WHAT YOU GET.

58
00:04:04,277 --> 00:04:07,997
Eldrie: I MUST SAY,
YOUR STYLE OF COMBAT,

59
00:04:07,997 --> 00:04:10,747
THERE’S SOMETHING
ODDLY FAMILIAR ABOUT IT.

60
00:04:10,747 --> 00:04:13,877
Kirito: REALLY? THEN I GUESS
YOU MUST HAVE COME UP

61
00:04:13,877 --> 00:04:16,497
AGAINST A SWORDSMAN
OF THE SERLUT STYLE BEFORE.

62
00:04:16,497 --> 00:04:17,757
( Eldrie chuckles )

63
00:04:17,757 --> 00:04:20,547
THAT, MY DEAR CRIMINAL,
IS NOT POSSIBLE.

64
00:04:20,547 --> 00:04:22,087
AS I PREVIOUSLY SAID,

65
00:04:22,087 --> 00:04:25,217
I WAS SUMMONED AS A KNIGHT
TO THIS REALM ONE MONTH AGO.

66
00:04:25,217 --> 00:04:27,637
Kirito: YEAH, RIGHT.
I BET YOU WERE.

67
00:04:27,637 --> 00:04:29,807
( gasps ) HOW’S THAT WORK?

68
00:04:29,807 --> 00:04:32,397
DOES SOMEONE SNAP THEIR FINGERS,
AND YOU COME RUNNING?

69
00:04:33,727 --> 00:04:35,307
( Eldrie grunts )

70
00:04:37,647 --> 00:04:38,317
( gasps )

71
00:04:44,447 --> 00:04:46,237
( Eugeo yells )

72
00:04:47,617 --> 00:04:49,287
Eldrie: RELEASE RECOLLECTION.

73
00:04:49,287 --> 00:04:50,617
( Kirito gasps )

74
00:04:52,707 --> 00:04:54,327
( Eugeo gasping )

75
00:04:56,337 --> 00:04:58,087
( yelling )

76
00:05:03,547 --> 00:05:06,507
Eldrie: NO WONDER
LADY ALICE WAS WARY OF YOU.

77
00:05:06,507 --> 00:05:08,467
YOUR ATTACKS HAVE NO PATTERN,

78
00:05:08,467 --> 00:05:11,477
WHICH IS SURPRISING
AND SLIGHTLY IRRITATING.

79
00:05:11,477 --> 00:05:12,887
WHAT IRRITATES ME MORE

80
00:05:12,887 --> 00:05:15,517
IS YOU FORCED ME TO USE
MY MEMORY RELEASE SKILL.

81
00:05:15,517 --> 00:05:17,727
( Eugeo gasps ) THAT’S IT.

82
00:05:17,727 --> 00:05:20,737
YEAH, NOW I KNOW
WHERE I HEARD YOUR NAME BEFORE.

83
00:05:20,737 --> 00:05:21,937
Eldrie: HMPH.

84
00:05:21,937 --> 00:05:24,527
Eugeo: YOU WERE
THE CHAMPION SWORDSMAN

85
00:05:24,527 --> 00:05:26,867
THIS YEAR
FOR NORLANGARTH EMPIRE,

86
00:05:26,867 --> 00:05:29,907
AND THEN YOU WON
THE UNIFICATION TOURNAMENT.

87
00:05:29,907 --> 00:05:32,867
YOU’RE ELDRIE WOOLSBURG!

88
00:05:32,867 --> 00:05:36,627
Eldrie: CHAMPION?
FROM THE NORLANGARTH EMPIRE?

89
00:05:36,627 --> 00:05:39,797
ELDRIE WOOLSBURG?

90
00:05:39,797 --> 00:05:41,587
Eugeo: IT’S TRUE, SIR KNIGHT.

91
00:05:41,587 --> 00:05:43,837
THIS YEAR,
IF I REMEMBER CORRECTLY,

92
00:05:43,837 --> 00:05:46,007
YOU WON EVERY MATCH
WITH A SINGLE STROKE.

93
00:05:46,007 --> 00:05:48,807
Eldrie: WHAT ARE YOU SAYING?!

94
00:05:48,807 --> 00:05:52,097
THAT’S PREPOSTEROUS! I AM
ELDRIE SYNTHESIS THIRTY-ONE!

95
00:05:52,097 --> 00:05:55,517
I HAVE NEVER HEARD
THE NAME "WOOLSBURG" BEFORE!

96
00:05:55,517 --> 00:05:56,807
Eugeo: BUT--
Eldrie: ENOUGH!

97
00:05:56,807 --> 00:05:59,567
HOLD YOUR TONGUE,
YOU BLASPHEMER!

98
00:05:59,567 --> 00:06:02,777
I-I WAS SUMMONED TO THIS WORLD
BY THE PONTIFEX!

99
00:06:02,777 --> 00:06:05,987
I-I AM HERE
BY ADMINISTRATOR’S WILL!

100
00:06:05,987 --> 00:06:08,317
I-I DESCENDED
AS AN INTEGRITY KNIGHT

101
00:06:08,317 --> 00:06:09,737
FROM THE HEAVENS, I TELL YOU!

102
00:06:09,737 --> 00:06:10,737
( sword clatters )

103
00:06:10,737 --> 00:06:12,617
( groaning )

104
00:06:12,617 --> 00:06:13,537
( both gasp )

105
00:06:17,667 --> 00:06:20,877
( Eldrie screaming )

106
00:06:20,877 --> 00:06:21,797
( gags )

107
00:06:24,587 --> 00:06:25,927
Eldrie: WH-WHAT’S THAT?

108
00:06:25,927 --> 00:06:29,097
♪

109
00:06:29,097 --> 00:06:31,717
Kirito: I BET ALICE
GOT ONE OF THOSE, TOO,

110
00:06:31,717 --> 00:06:34,427
WHEN THEY BLOCKED HER MEMORY
AND CHANGED HER.

111
00:06:34,427 --> 00:06:35,887
( gasps ) ELDRIE!

112
00:06:35,887 --> 00:06:37,727
ELDRIE WOOLSBURG!

113
00:06:37,727 --> 00:06:38,397
( Eldrie groans )

114
00:06:40,187 --> 00:06:41,977
EUGEO, KNOW ANYTHING ELSE
ABOUT HIM?

115
00:06:41,977 --> 00:06:43,777
ANYTHING AT ALL?

116
00:06:43,777 --> 00:06:45,607
SOMETHING TO TRIGGER
MORE OF HIS MEMORY!

117
00:06:45,607 --> 00:06:47,737
( Eugeo grunts ) ELDRIE!

118
00:06:47,737 --> 00:06:50,777
YOUR FATHER
IS ESCHDOR WOOLSBURG,

119
00:06:50,777 --> 00:06:52,737
THE IMPERIAL KNIGHTS’S GENERAL!

120
00:06:52,737 --> 00:06:55,707
YOUR MOTHER’S NAME IS,
I THINK, ALMERA?

121
00:06:55,707 --> 00:06:57,917
- ( Eldrie gasps )
- Eugeo: YEAH, IT’S ALMERA!

122
00:06:57,917 --> 00:07:00,997
Eldrie: A-ALMERA.

123
00:07:05,087 --> 00:07:07,797
MOTHER?

124
00:07:09,387 --> 00:07:10,967
Kirito: THAT’S RIGHT!
REMEMBER HER!

125
00:07:10,967 --> 00:07:13,507
REMEMBER!

126
00:07:13,507 --> 00:07:14,597
( groaning )

127
00:07:14,597 --> 00:07:15,847
Eugeo: KIRITO!

128
00:07:17,977 --> 00:07:19,477
( Kirito yells )

129
00:07:19,477 --> 00:07:23,107
♪

130
00:07:23,107 --> 00:07:24,727
- ( crackle )
- ( gasps )

131
00:07:27,067 --> 00:07:29,027
Eugeo: YOU OKAY?!

132
00:07:29,027 --> 00:07:31,987
Deusolbert: STEP AWAY FROM
KNIGHT THIRTY-ONE, CRIMINALS.

133
00:07:33,117 --> 00:07:34,827
TEMPTING AN INTEGRITY KNIGHT

134
00:07:34,827 --> 00:07:39,037
TO FALL FROM GRACE
IS UNFORGIVEABLE, YOU WRETCHES.

135
00:07:39,037 --> 00:07:42,707
I SHALL PIN YOU DOWN,
THEN RETURN YOU TO YOUR CELL.

136
00:07:42,707 --> 00:07:44,127
( both gasp )

137
00:07:44,127 --> 00:07:45,207
Kirito: THIS WAY!

138
00:07:48,717 --> 00:07:50,547
( both gasp )

139
00:07:51,797 --> 00:07:53,387
Kirito: WHICH WAY?

140
00:07:54,387 --> 00:07:55,557
Woman: GO RIGHT!

141
00:07:55,557 --> 00:07:57,597
( Kirito gasps )
EUGEO, GO RIGHT!

142
00:07:57,597 --> 00:07:59,477
♪

143
00:08:05,687 --> 00:08:08,107
Eugeo: DEAD END UP AHEAD!
WHAT DO WE DO?!

144
00:08:08,107 --> 00:08:10,067
- Girl: HEY!
- Kirito: HUH?

145
00:08:10,067 --> 00:08:11,777
Girl: OVER HERE!

146
00:08:11,777 --> 00:08:13,027
Woman: FOLLOW HER!

147
00:08:13,027 --> 00:08:14,367
( Kirito gasps )

148
00:08:25,837 --> 00:08:27,087
( gasps )

149
00:08:27,087 --> 00:08:28,007
( yells )

150
00:08:30,797 --> 00:08:32,797
( moans )

151
00:08:32,797 --> 00:08:34,137
( both gasp )

152
00:08:34,137 --> 00:08:36,097
Kirito: WHERE ARE WE?

153
00:08:36,097 --> 00:08:38,347
( door opens )

154
00:08:38,347 --> 00:08:40,687
Girl: NOW THEY KNOW WE’RE HERE.

155
00:08:40,687 --> 00:08:42,647
WE CAN’T USE
THIS BACKDOOR ANYMORE.

156
00:08:54,317 --> 00:08:57,447
Kirito: THANK YOU.
WE WERE REALLY IN A BIND.

157
00:08:57,447 --> 00:08:58,987
- WHO ARE YOU?
- Eugeo: I’M EUGEO.

158
00:08:58,987 --> 00:09:00,037
IT’S NICE TO MEET YOU.

159
00:09:00,037 --> 00:09:01,077
Kirito: WAIT A SEC.

160
00:09:01,077 --> 00:09:03,577
Eugeo: AND THIS IS KIRITO.

161
00:09:03,577 --> 00:09:05,537
( Kirito groans )

162
00:09:05,537 --> 00:09:07,037
( girl sighs )

163
00:09:07,037 --> 00:09:08,497
( metal clinking )

164
00:09:08,497 --> 00:09:10,797
Eugeo: WE REALLY
APPRECIATE YOUR HELP.

165
00:09:10,797 --> 00:09:13,217
IS THIS, UM, WHERE YOU LIVE?

166
00:09:13,217 --> 00:09:15,087
Girl: NO. OF COURSE IT ISN’T.

167
00:09:16,717 --> 00:09:18,007
COME WITH ME.

168
00:09:18,007 --> 00:09:21,177
( staff rings clinking )

169
00:09:21,177 --> 00:09:24,977
Kirito: SO, UH, ARE WE
IN THE CENTRAL CATHEDRAL?

170
00:09:24,977 --> 00:09:26,357
Girl: YES AND NO,

171
00:09:26,357 --> 00:09:28,477
BUT NEITHER OF YOU
HAVE TO WORRY.

172
00:09:28,477 --> 00:09:31,687
ALTHOUGH THIS SPACE
IS TECHNICALLY IN THE CATHEDRAL,

173
00:09:31,687 --> 00:09:33,947
I’VE DELETED
THE REGULAR DOORWAY TO IT.

174
00:09:33,947 --> 00:09:36,277
NO ONE CAN ENTER HERE
FROM THAT POINT NOW.

175
00:09:37,657 --> 00:09:40,327
WELL, UNLESS I INVITE THEM.

176
00:09:43,907 --> 00:09:44,827
( both wince )

177
00:09:48,707 --> 00:09:50,627
♪

178
00:09:51,957 --> 00:09:53,217
( Kirito gasps )

179
00:09:53,217 --> 00:09:55,337
Eugeo: IT’S A LIBRARY.

180
00:09:55,337 --> 00:09:57,967
Girl: INDEED.
THE RECORDS OF THIS WORLD’S

181
00:09:57,967 --> 00:10:01,177
ENTIRE HISTORY ARE HERE,
AS WELL AS THE FORMULAS

182
00:10:01,177 --> 00:10:03,927
OF EVERYTHING CREATED
UNDER THE HEAVENS.

183
00:10:03,927 --> 00:10:06,147
THAT INCLUDES
EVERY SYSTEM COMMAND,

184
00:10:06,147 --> 00:10:09,147
OR WHAT YOU REFER TO
AS "THE SACRED ARTS."

185
00:10:09,147 --> 00:10:10,977
Kirito: W-WAIT.
S-SYSTEM COMMANDS?

186
00:10:10,977 --> 00:10:12,857
WHO ARE YOU?

187
00:10:12,857 --> 00:10:15,107
Girl: MY NAME IS CARDINAL.

188
00:10:15,107 --> 00:10:17,817
I WAS ONCE THE REGULATOR
OF THIS WORLD,

189
00:10:17,817 --> 00:10:21,577
BUT NOW I AM THE SOLE CURATOR
OF THIS GREAT LIBRARY.

190
00:10:23,287 --> 00:10:24,787
Eugeo: ALL OUR HISTORY?

191
00:10:24,787 --> 00:10:26,037
Cardinal: PRECISELY.

192
00:10:26,037 --> 00:10:28,207
THERE IS ALSO
A RECORD OF THE CREATION,

193
00:10:28,207 --> 00:10:30,167
WHEN VECTA AND STACIA
SPLIT THE WORLD

194
00:10:30,167 --> 00:10:32,667
INTO THE HUMAN EMPIRE
AND THE DARK TERRITORY.

195
00:10:34,087 --> 00:10:35,877
YOU MAY READ THEM IF YOU WISH.

196
00:10:37,887 --> 00:10:40,097
BUT, FIRST, WOULD YOU
HOLD OUT YOUR RIGHT HANDS?

197
00:10:40,097 --> 00:10:41,177
Both: HMM?

198
00:10:43,057 --> 00:10:43,967
Cardinal: HMM.

199
00:10:45,097 --> 00:10:46,137
THERE.

200
00:10:47,937 --> 00:10:50,647
- ( Eugeo gasps )
- Kirito: WHOA!

201
00:10:50,647 --> 00:10:51,727
Eugeo: AH-CHOO!

202
00:10:51,727 --> 00:10:53,817
Kirito: UH, YOU FEELIN’ OKAY?

203
00:10:53,817 --> 00:10:55,737
- Eugeo: YEAH.
- Cardinal: HUH.

204
00:10:57,317 --> 00:10:59,487
YOU’RE GOING TO CATCH A COLD

205
00:10:59,487 --> 00:11:01,777
IF YOU STAY
IN THOSE WET CLOTHES.

206
00:11:01,777 --> 00:11:03,697
AT THE END OF THE HALL
THROUGH THERE,

207
00:11:03,697 --> 00:11:05,367
YOU’LL FIND
A SMALL BATH YOU MAY USE.

208
00:11:06,907 --> 00:11:08,247
Eugeo: THANKS A LOT.

209
00:11:08,247 --> 00:11:10,287
I’M GRATEFUL
FOR YOUR HOSPITALITY.

210
00:11:10,287 --> 00:11:13,087
CAN I, UM, SEE THE, UM...

211
00:11:13,087 --> 00:11:15,087
- Cardinal: HMM?
- Eugeo: RECORD OF CREATION?

212
00:11:15,087 --> 00:11:16,797
( Cardinal chuckles )

213
00:11:16,797 --> 00:11:19,837
IT IS LOCATED UP THE STAIRS
IN THE HISTORY SECTION.

214
00:11:19,837 --> 00:11:22,717
AFTER YOU BATHE, YOU MAY
READ IT WITH YOUR SUPPER.

215
00:11:22,717 --> 00:11:25,717
( Eugeo gasps )
YOU’RE MUCH TOO KIND.

216
00:11:25,717 --> 00:11:27,057
I’LL BE BACK IN A BIT, THEN.

217
00:11:28,187 --> 00:11:30,397
( sneezes )

218
00:11:30,397 --> 00:11:32,357
- ( sniffles )
- ( Cardinal sighs )

219
00:11:32,357 --> 00:11:34,567
WHAT THOSE RECORDS
WON’T REVEAL

220
00:11:34,567 --> 00:11:37,857
IS THAT THE PONTIFEX
OF THE AXIOM CHURCH

221
00:11:37,857 --> 00:11:39,147
FABRICATED ALL OF IT.

222
00:11:39,147 --> 00:11:41,697
( Kirito gasps )
LET ME GET THIS STRAIGHT.

223
00:11:41,697 --> 00:11:43,367
YOU’RE SAYIN’
THE GODS HERE ARE FAKE?

224
00:11:43,367 --> 00:11:45,117
Cardinal: YES.

225
00:11:45,117 --> 00:11:48,157
THE MYTHS THE PEOPLE
OF THE UNDERWORLD BELIEVE

226
00:11:48,157 --> 00:11:50,367
ARE JUST PROPAGANDA,

227
00:11:50,367 --> 00:11:53,127
ALL INVENTED BY THE CHURCH
TO MAINTAIN ITS CONTROL.

228
00:11:53,127 --> 00:11:55,917
THE GODS’S NAMES ARE REGISTERED

229
00:11:55,917 --> 00:11:58,877
AS SUPERVISOR ACCOUNTS
IN CASE OF EMERGENCY,

230
00:11:58,877 --> 00:12:02,797
BUT THE HUMANS OUTSIDE
NEVER LOGGED IN USING THEM.

231
00:12:02,797 --> 00:12:05,257
( Kirito gasps ) WAIT A SEC.

232
00:12:05,257 --> 00:12:08,307
HOW WOULD YOU KNOW
ANYTHING ABOUT THE REAL WORLD?

233
00:12:08,307 --> 00:12:10,227
YOU WEREN’T BORN HERE, WERE YOU?

234
00:12:10,227 --> 00:12:13,937
YOU’RE AN OUTSIDER,
JUST LIKE THE SYSTEM ADMINS!

235
00:12:13,937 --> 00:12:17,397
Cardinal: YES, AND I KNOW
YOU’RE AN OUTSIDER, TOO...

236
00:12:17,397 --> 00:12:19,027
KIRITO THE UNREGISTERED.

237
00:12:20,107 --> 00:12:22,617
Kirito: YEAH, I AM.

238
00:12:22,617 --> 00:12:26,537
A COMPANY CALLED RATH
IS THE ONE THAT MADE THIS WORLD.

239
00:12:26,537 --> 00:12:28,747
- YOU KNOW THAT.
- Cardinal: YES, I DO.

240
00:12:28,747 --> 00:12:31,457
Kirito: THEN YOU MUST BE
THE CARDINAL SYSTEM.

241
00:12:31,457 --> 00:12:34,497
YOU’RE AN AUTONOMOUS PROGRAM,
AREN’T YOU? YOU RUN THIS WORLD.

242
00:12:34,497 --> 00:12:37,497
Cardinal:
AH, SO YOU KNOW ABOUT ME.

243
00:12:37,497 --> 00:12:39,417
THEN YOU’VE INTERACTED
WITH MY KIND BEFORE

244
00:12:39,417 --> 00:12:41,217
IN THE OUTERWORLD.

245
00:12:41,217 --> 00:12:43,547
Kirito: OH, YEAH.

246
00:12:43,547 --> 00:12:47,257
BUT YOU’RE DIFFERENT.
AS FAR AS I KNOW,

247
00:12:47,257 --> 00:12:50,977
THE CARDINAL SYSTEM
NEVER HAD A HUMANLIKE INTERFACE,

248
00:12:50,977 --> 00:12:52,977
SO WHAT KIND
OF PROGRAM ARE YOU?

249
00:12:52,977 --> 00:12:55,357
WHAT DO YOU DO HERE?

250
00:12:55,357 --> 00:12:56,567
( Cardinal sighs )

251
00:12:58,647 --> 00:13:01,067
I’LL TRY TO BE
AS SUCCINCT AS POSSIBLE.

252
00:13:01,067 --> 00:13:03,157
BUT, FIRST, EAT.

253
00:13:03,157 --> 00:13:05,067
♪

254
00:13:06,407 --> 00:13:07,867
( Kirito gasps )

255
00:13:07,867 --> 00:13:09,617
Cardinal:
I’VE CAST A SPELL ON IT

256
00:13:09,617 --> 00:13:11,827
THAT WILL HELP
YOUR WOUNDS HEAL FASTER.

257
00:13:11,827 --> 00:13:14,077
Kirito: WOW.
NOW, THAT’S AN ADMIN FOR YOU.

258
00:13:14,077 --> 00:13:16,377
Cardinal: I AM
NOT AN ADMINISTRATOR.

259
00:13:16,377 --> 00:13:18,247
I CAN ONLY MANIPULATE
THE OBJECTS

260
00:13:18,247 --> 00:13:21,127
THAT ARE CONTAINED
IN THIS LIBRARY.

261
00:13:21,127 --> 00:13:23,797
Kirito: OH! CARDINAL,
CAN YOU GET IN TOUCH

262
00:13:23,797 --> 00:13:25,637
WITH SOMEONE
IN THE REAL WORLD FOR ME?

263
00:13:25,637 --> 00:13:28,057
Cardinal: OF COURSE NOT!
IF I COULD DO THAT,

264
00:13:28,057 --> 00:13:30,307
I WOULDN’T BE STUCK HERE
IN THIS DUSTY PLACE

265
00:13:30,307 --> 00:13:32,017
FOR ALL THESE CENTURIES.

266
00:13:32,017 --> 00:13:33,637
UNFORTUNATELY, THE ONLY ONE

267
00:13:33,637 --> 00:13:35,977
WHO HAS THAT AUTHORITY
IS THE PONTIFEX.

268
00:13:35,977 --> 00:13:37,107
( Kirito sighs ) CRAP.

269
00:13:37,107 --> 00:13:38,687
Cardinal: THERE.

270
00:13:44,237 --> 00:13:48,527
I TOLD YOU EARLIER THAT NO GODS
EXIST IN THIS WORLD.

271
00:13:48,527 --> 00:13:50,367
TECHNICALLY, THAT’S TRUE,

272
00:13:50,367 --> 00:13:53,537
BUT THERE WAS ONCE A TIME
WHEN SOMETHING SIMILAR DID.

273
00:13:53,537 --> 00:13:57,127
THAT WAS ABOUT 450 YEARS AGO.

274
00:13:57,127 --> 00:14:00,337
BACK WHEN CENTORIA WAS
NO MORE THAN A TINY VILLAGE,

275
00:14:00,337 --> 00:14:01,917
THERE WERE FOUR GODS.

276
00:14:01,917 --> 00:14:03,667
Kirito: LET ME GUESS.

277
00:14:03,667 --> 00:14:06,927
THEY WERE THE FOUR STAFF MEMBERS
FROM RATH WHO BUILT THIS PLACE.

278
00:14:06,927 --> 00:14:08,797
Cardinal: YOU ARE CORRECT.

279
00:14:08,797 --> 00:14:11,767
TWO MALES AND TWO FEMALES
CAME TO THIS LAND.

280
00:14:11,767 --> 00:14:15,137
EACH COUPLE RAISED EIGHT
CHILDREN EACH ON TWO FARMS.

281
00:14:15,137 --> 00:14:16,847
THEY TAUGHT THEM
TO READ AND WRITE

282
00:14:16,847 --> 00:14:20,687
AND HOW TO RAISE CROPS
AND LIVESTOCK, TOO,

283
00:14:20,687 --> 00:14:23,487
AND THE MORAL ARGUMENTS
OF GOOD AND EVIL,

284
00:14:23,487 --> 00:14:26,157
WHICH FORMED THE BASIS
OF THE TABOO INDEX.

285
00:14:26,157 --> 00:14:29,067
BASED ON HOW EFFECTIVELY
THE FIRST FOUR

286
00:14:29,067 --> 00:14:31,487
WERE ABLE TO PASS DOWN
THESE TEACHINGS,

287
00:14:31,487 --> 00:14:33,407
IT’S CLEAR THAT, AS HUMANS,

288
00:14:33,407 --> 00:14:35,537
THEY WERE
INCREDIBLY INTELLIGENT.

289
00:14:35,537 --> 00:14:37,287
HOWEVER...

290
00:14:37,287 --> 00:14:40,167
THERE WAS ONE AMONG THEM
WHO WAS NOT ONLY BRILLIANT,

291
00:14:40,167 --> 00:14:42,377
BUT DEVIOUS AS WELL.

292
00:14:42,377 --> 00:14:46,007
THE CHILDREN THIS PERSON RAISED
INHERITED SELFISH DESIRES,

293
00:14:46,007 --> 00:14:48,677
SUCH AS THE HUNGER
TO RULE AND CONQUER.

294
00:14:48,677 --> 00:14:50,547
THE OFFSPRING OF THESE CHILDREN

295
00:14:50,547 --> 00:14:53,267
WOULD EVENTUALLY BECOME
THE NOBLES OF THIS LAND,

296
00:14:53,267 --> 00:14:56,887
AS WELL AS THE HIGH MINISTERS
OF THE AXIOM CHURCH.

297
00:14:56,887 --> 00:15:00,227
ONE OF THEM,
THE CURRENT SYSTEM SUPERVISOR,

298
00:15:00,227 --> 00:15:03,107
IS THE PONTIFEX
OF THE AXIOM CHURCH,

299
00:15:03,107 --> 00:15:06,567
A WOMAN WHO CONTROLS
EVERYTHING WITH AN IRON FIST.

300
00:15:06,567 --> 00:15:09,157
SHE CALLS HERSELF ADMINISTRATOR,

301
00:15:09,157 --> 00:15:11,277
THE MOST ARROGANT NAME
IMAGINABLE.

302
00:15:11,277 --> 00:15:13,237
Kirito: THAT NAME...

303
00:15:13,237 --> 00:15:15,747
I HEARD THAT ELDRIE GUY SAY IT.

304
00:15:15,747 --> 00:15:18,207
THAT’S RIGHT.
HE SAID HE WAS, LIKE,

305
00:15:18,207 --> 00:15:21,497
SUMMONED BY THIS PONTIFEX
ADMINISTRATOR OR SOMETHING.

306
00:15:21,497 --> 00:15:25,207
Cardinal: YES. SHE’S THE ONE
I’VE BEEN TALKING ABOUT.

307
00:15:25,207 --> 00:15:29,337
SADLY, THIS ADMINISTRATOR,
WHILE I DON’T LIKE TO ADMIT IT,

308
00:15:29,337 --> 00:15:31,597
IS MY ELDER TWIN SISTER,
SO TO SPEAK.

309
00:15:31,597 --> 00:15:33,557
Kirito: SHE IS? HOW DO YOU MEAN?

310
00:15:33,557 --> 00:15:35,717
Cardinal: I’M GETTING TO THAT.

311
00:15:35,717 --> 00:15:38,847
SEVERAL DECADES
AFTER THE FIRST FOUR LOGGED OUT,

312
00:15:38,847 --> 00:15:41,437
THE FIRST POLITICAL MARRIAGE
WAS ARRANGED

313
00:15:41,437 --> 00:15:44,397
BETWEEN TWO FAMILIES
OF THE LORD CLASS.

314
00:15:44,397 --> 00:15:48,027
FROM THAT UNION,
A BABY GIRL WAS BORN.

315
00:15:48,027 --> 00:15:49,487
( sighs )

316
00:15:49,487 --> 00:15:53,157
HER NAME WAS QUINELLA.

317
00:15:53,157 --> 00:15:56,327
Man: QUINELLA, MY DEAR,

318
00:15:56,327 --> 00:16:00,367
HENCEFORTH, YOUR CALLING
IS TO RESEARCH THE SACRED ARTS.

319
00:16:00,367 --> 00:16:03,287
Quinella: NOTHING WOULD
MAKE ME HAPPIER, FATHER.

320
00:16:03,287 --> 00:16:03,957
THANK YOU.

321
00:16:05,547 --> 00:16:08,007
SYSTEM CALL.

322
00:16:08,007 --> 00:16:10,377
NO ONE ELSE REALIZES IT,

323
00:16:10,377 --> 00:16:13,467
BUT EACH SACRED WORD
HAS ITS OWN MEANING.

324
00:16:13,467 --> 00:16:15,717
"CALL" MEANS TO SUMMON.

325
00:16:15,717 --> 00:16:17,927
"GENERATE" MEANS TO PRODUCE.

326
00:16:17,927 --> 00:16:18,927
( chuckles )

327
00:16:18,927 --> 00:16:21,517
( children laughing )

328
00:16:21,517 --> 00:16:23,147
Girl: COME ON! THIS WAY!

329
00:16:23,147 --> 00:16:25,227
♪

330
00:16:25,227 --> 00:16:26,437
( brush rustles )

331
00:16:26,437 --> 00:16:27,437
( Quinella gasps )

332
00:16:27,437 --> 00:16:28,777
( flying fox chitters )

333
00:16:31,317 --> 00:16:32,357
( Quinella chuckles )

334
00:16:32,357 --> 00:16:34,617
SYSTEM CALL.

335
00:16:34,617 --> 00:16:37,407
GENERATE THERMAL ELEMENT.

336
00:16:37,407 --> 00:16:39,577
FORM ELEMENT, ARROW SHAPE.

337
00:16:39,577 --> 00:16:40,617
FLY STRAIGHT.

338
00:16:40,617 --> 00:16:42,497
DISCHARGE!

339
00:16:42,497 --> 00:16:44,077
( flying fox squeals )

340
00:16:45,667 --> 00:16:46,997
( Quinella giggles )

341
00:16:53,297 --> 00:16:54,797
( laughing )

342
00:16:59,767 --> 00:17:04,397
Woman: LADY QUINELLA, PLEASE,
HELP MY HUSBAND WALK AGAIN!

343
00:17:04,397 --> 00:17:05,187
Quinella: VERY WELL.

344
00:17:06,567 --> 00:17:08,567
SYSTEM CALL.

345
00:17:08,567 --> 00:17:11,397
GENERATE LUMINOUS ELEMENT.

346
00:17:11,397 --> 00:17:13,777
FORM ELEMENT, LIQUID SHAPE.

347
00:17:15,367 --> 00:17:16,367
( woman gasps )

348
00:17:16,367 --> 00:17:18,037
( crowd murmuring )

349
00:17:20,657 --> 00:17:22,077
Husband: IT’S A MIRACLE.

350
00:17:22,077 --> 00:17:25,787
LADY QUINELLA, YOU ARE
THE HOLY CHILD OF STACIA!

351
00:17:25,787 --> 00:17:28,167
Woman 2: BLESS YOU,
LADY QUINELLA!

352
00:17:28,167 --> 00:17:30,757
Cardinal: BUT HER GENTLE SMILE
WAS A MASK.

353
00:17:30,757 --> 00:17:33,677
QUINELLA HAD DEVELOPED
A THIRST FOR POWER,

354
00:17:33,677 --> 00:17:36,597
AND NOW SHE HAD
THE MEANS TO SEIZE IT.

355
00:17:38,427 --> 00:17:41,097
♪

356
00:17:41,097 --> 00:17:43,387
Quinella: VERY SOON,
WE WILL HAVE A PLACE

357
00:17:43,387 --> 00:17:44,687
WHERE WE CAN WORSHIP THE GODS.

358
00:17:44,687 --> 00:17:46,607
( crowd gasping, murmuring )

359
00:17:53,357 --> 00:17:56,237
Quinella: IN ORDER TO CONTROL
THE GROWING POPULATION,

360
00:17:56,237 --> 00:17:58,827
I MUST PUT SOME LAWS INTO PLACE.

361
00:17:58,827 --> 00:18:03,707
TO ENSURE NO ONE ELSE
EXCEEDS MY AUTHORITY LEVEL,

362
00:18:03,707 --> 00:18:05,367
I WILL MAKE HUNTING TABOO.

363
00:18:06,707 --> 00:18:08,917
I WILL OUTLAW MURDER AS WELL.

364
00:18:13,757 --> 00:18:16,387
Man: LADY QUINELLA,
YOU WISHED TO SEE ME?

365
00:18:16,387 --> 00:18:18,427
Quinella: THIS IS A HOLY BOOK

366
00:18:18,427 --> 00:18:21,137
CONTAINING THE COMPLETE WORDS
OF THE GODDESS STACIA.

367
00:18:21,137 --> 00:18:23,387
IT IS CALLED THE TABOO INDEX.

368
00:18:23,387 --> 00:18:27,187
MAKE COPIES, DISTRIBUTE IT
TO EVERY TOWN AND VILLAGE,

369
00:18:27,187 --> 00:18:29,187
AND HAVE THE PEOPLE OBEY IT.

370
00:18:29,187 --> 00:18:29,897
Man: YES, MILADY.

371
00:18:31,647 --> 00:18:33,357
( Quinella gasping )

372
00:18:34,437 --> 00:18:36,357
♪

373
00:18:49,417 --> 00:18:51,497
( panting )

374
00:18:56,127 --> 00:18:57,337
( coughs )

375
00:18:57,337 --> 00:18:58,757
( thunder rumbling )

376
00:18:58,757 --> 00:19:01,467
( chorus vocalizing )

377
00:19:01,467 --> 00:19:03,307
SYSTEM CALL.

378
00:19:03,307 --> 00:19:06,557
OPEN LIST.

379
00:19:06,557 --> 00:19:08,517
SYSTEM CALL.

380
00:19:08,517 --> 00:19:10,937
READ LIST.

381
00:19:12,357 --> 00:19:15,317
( coughs )

382
00:19:15,317 --> 00:19:17,067
( panting )

383
00:19:21,617 --> 00:19:23,487
( thunder crashes )

384
00:19:23,487 --> 00:19:26,157
SYSTEM CALL.

385
00:19:26,157 --> 00:19:29,367
INSPECT LIST.

386
00:19:30,577 --> 00:19:32,127
( gasps )

387
00:19:32,127 --> 00:19:36,547
Cardinal: FINALLY
QUINELLA OPENED IT...

388
00:19:36,547 --> 00:19:37,547
THE FORBIDDEN DOOR.

389
00:19:37,547 --> 00:19:39,967
( thunder crashes )

390
00:19:41,507 --> 00:19:44,887
IT WAS QUITE THE COINCIDENCE,

391
00:19:44,887 --> 00:19:48,517
ALTHOUGH I SUSPECT SOMEONE FROM
THE OUTSIDE WORLD HELPED HER.

392
00:19:48,517 --> 00:19:49,517
( rings clink )

393
00:19:49,517 --> 00:19:51,357
LET ME SHOW YOU.

394
00:19:51,357 --> 00:19:52,687
SYSTEM CALL!

395
00:19:52,687 --> 00:19:55,147
INSPECT ENTIRE COMMAND LIST!

396
00:19:57,237 --> 00:19:58,697
Kirito: YOU’RE KIDDING.

397
00:19:58,697 --> 00:20:00,567
Cardinal:
WHAT YOU SEE BEFORE YOU,

398
00:20:00,567 --> 00:20:02,157
IS THE FULL CATALOG

399
00:20:02,157 --> 00:20:04,657
OF ALL THE UNDERWORLD’S
SYSTEM COMMANDS.

400
00:20:04,657 --> 00:20:07,077
QUINELLA’S
FIRST ORDER OF BUSINESS

401
00:20:07,077 --> 00:20:10,867
WAS TO RESTORE HER LIFE
AND HALT THE AGING PROCESS.

402
00:20:10,867 --> 00:20:13,377
THEN SHE RESTORED HER BEAUTY.

403
00:20:15,337 --> 00:20:17,087
- IN AN INSTANT...
- ( thunder crashes )

404
00:20:17,087 --> 00:20:20,427
SHE REGAINED THE DAZZLING ALLURE
OF HER LATE TEENS.

405
00:20:20,427 --> 00:20:22,717
( thunder crashes )

406
00:20:22,717 --> 00:20:25,467
( Quinella laughing )

407
00:20:25,467 --> 00:20:27,597
Cardinal: THAT SHOULD HAVE
BEEN ENOUGH TO SATISFY HER...

408
00:20:29,177 --> 00:20:30,687
BUT NO.

409
00:20:30,687 --> 00:20:33,647
FOR QUINELLA, THERE COULD BE
NO ONE EQUAL TO HER.

410
00:20:33,647 --> 00:20:35,687
- ( thunder crashes )
- ( Kirito gasps )

411
00:20:35,687 --> 00:20:37,147
Cardinal:
EVEN THE CARDINAL SYSTEM

412
00:20:37,147 --> 00:20:38,897
WAS SOMETHING
SHE DEEMED A THREAT,

413
00:20:38,897 --> 00:20:41,027
SO SHE DEVISED A WAY

414
00:20:41,027 --> 00:20:43,867
TO SEIZE THE CARDINAL SYSTEM’S
AUTHORITY LEVEL

415
00:20:43,867 --> 00:20:47,487
USING A SACRED ART COMMAND
SHE COMPOSED.

416
00:20:47,487 --> 00:20:50,157
AS A RESULT...

417
00:20:50,157 --> 00:20:53,497
SHE BURNED THE PRIME DIRECTIVE
OF THE CARDINAL SYSTEM

418
00:20:53,497 --> 00:20:56,797
INTO HER FLUCTLIGHT
AS HER OWN BEHAVIORAL PRINCIPLE.

419
00:20:56,797 --> 00:20:59,507
THAT WAY,
IT COULD NOT BE OVERWRITTEN.

420
00:20:59,507 --> 00:21:02,217
SHE JUST WANTED
ITS AUTHORITY LEVEL.

421
00:21:02,217 --> 00:21:03,887
INSTEAD, SHE ENDED UP

422
00:21:03,887 --> 00:21:06,717
FUSING HER SOUL
WITH THE CARDINAL SYSTEM.

423
00:21:06,717 --> 00:21:08,427
"TO UPHOLD ORDER,"

424
00:21:08,427 --> 00:21:12,017
THAT IS THE PRIME DIRECTIVE
OF THE CARDINAL SYSTEM

425
00:21:12,017 --> 00:21:13,727
AND ITS REASON FOR EXISTING.

426
00:21:13,727 --> 00:21:15,727
AS SOMEONE
WHO SPENT TIME IN A WORLD

427
00:21:15,727 --> 00:21:19,027
CONTROLLED BY THE SAME SYSTEM,
YOU SHOULD UNDERSTAND.

428
00:21:19,027 --> 00:21:22,317
CARDINAL OBSERVES THE ACTIONS
OF PLAYERS LIKE YOU,

429
00:21:22,317 --> 00:21:23,657
AND IT CORRECTS ANYTHING

430
00:21:23,657 --> 00:21:25,817
THAT DISRUPTS
THE BALANCE OF THE WORLD

431
00:21:25,817 --> 00:21:27,777
WITHOUT ANY MERCY.

432
00:21:27,777 --> 00:21:30,497
( Kirito gasps )

433
00:21:30,497 --> 00:21:32,997
♪

434
00:21:32,997 --> 00:21:35,207
Cardinal: QUINELLA HAD FAINTED

435
00:21:35,207 --> 00:21:38,457
AND WAS UNCONSCIOUS
FOR AN ENTIRE DAY.

436
00:21:38,457 --> 00:21:40,047
WHEN SHE WOKE UP,

437
00:21:40,047 --> 00:21:43,967
SHE HAD CEASED BEING HUMAN
IN ANY SENSE OF THE WORD.

438
00:21:43,967 --> 00:21:47,507
SHE NO LONGER AGED
OR REQUIRED SUSTENANCE.

439
00:21:47,507 --> 00:21:49,927
HER ONLY DESIRE
WAS TO PRESERVE THIS REALM

440
00:21:49,927 --> 00:21:52,557
IN ITS CURRENT STATE FOREVER.

441
00:21:54,187 --> 00:21:57,227
Quinella: I AM BOTH
RULER AND SUPERVISOR

442
00:21:57,227 --> 00:22:01,187
AND NOW THE PONTIFEX
OF THE AXIOM CHURCH AS WELL.

443
00:22:02,647 --> 00:22:05,107
I AM ADMINISTRATOR.

444
00:22:05,107 --> 00:22:05,947
♪

445
00:22:05,947 --> 00:22:07,617
( singing in Japanese )

446
00:22:42,027 --> 00:22:45,857
♪ THE IRIS TO YOU ♪

